BlueTTSKit is vendored into Codeg Plus from Jonathan Ashurov's codeg-voice
repository with git subtree. It ships under two licences:

- BlueTTSKit (Sources/BlueTTSKit, Sources/bluetts-cli, Tests, scripts) and the
  vendored ONNX Runtime Objective-C bindings (Sources/OnnxRuntimeBindings, see
  the LICENSE file there): MIT, below.
- BlueTTSEspeak (Sources/BlueTTSEspeak) and espeak-ng with ucd-tools
  (Sources/CEspeakNG, see COPYING there): GPL-3.0-or-later. An app that links
  BlueTTSEspeak is a combined GPL-3 work.

BlueTTSKit ports Light-BlueTTS (github.com/maxmelichov/Light-BlueTTS, MIT) and
renikud-plus (MIT). The model weights are not part of this package; they are
downloaded at runtime. The RenikudPlus weights are Apache-2.0; the BlueTTS 2.5
weights (notmax123/BlueTTS2.5-onnx) declare no licence.

